# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# TEST ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# 
# This file contains environment variables for testing.
# These are MOCK/FAKE values for testing purposes only.
#
# SETUP FOR TESTING:
# 1. Copy this file: cp .env.test.example .env.test
# 2. Values below are safe defaults for testing
# 3. Run tests: npm test
#
# ⚠️ NEVER use real API keys in tests!
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# CORE TEST CONFIGURATION
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
NODE_ENV=test
PORT=3001
UNIVERSE_KEY=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# MOCK API KEYS FOR TESTING
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# These are properly formatted MOCK keys for format validation tests
# They are NOT real keys and will not work with actual APIs

# OpenAI mock key (proper format: sk- + 48 chars)
TEST_OPENAI_KEY=sk-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# GitHub mock token (proper format: ghp_ + 36 chars)
TEST_GITHUB_TOKEN=ghp_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# GitHub PAT mock (proper format: github_pat_ + characters)
TEST_GITHUB_PAT=github_pat_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# Anthropic mock key (proper format: sk-ant- + chars)
TEST_ANTHROPIC_KEY=sk-ant-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# Groq mock key (proper format: gsk- + chars)
TEST_GROQ_KEY=gsk-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# CoinGecko mock key (proper format: CG- + chars)
TEST_COINGECKO_KEY=CG-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# TEST DATABASE (Use separate test DB!)
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
TEST_SUPABASE_URL=https://test-project.supabase.co
TEST_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.test.mock

# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# NOTES FOR DEVELOPERS
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 
# 1. These are MOCK values for format validation only
# 2. Tests should work without real API access
# 3. For integration tests that need real APIs:
#    - Use a separate test account
#    - Never commit those credentials
#    - Document which tests require real credentials
# 4. Add this file to .gitignore (already done)
#
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
